8. The 7-Node KEYSTONE Dome — Automation Architecture

The dome is not a metaphor in the automation context — it is a literal software architecture. Understanding how the physical components map to the dome structure is essential for building, maintaining, and scaling it. Every component below has a specific technical equivalent in the Microsoft Azure and M365 ecosystem.

